PRIL 30, 2021 AND AUGUST 31, 2021, INCLUSIVE (THE...'}{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2022-06-03 05:45:00', 'title': 'ABBV SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS ABBVIE SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JUNE 6, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF ABBVIE INC. (NYSE: ABBV). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/ABBVIE-INC-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=28010&FROM=4 THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES FOR SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED ABBVIE BETWEEN APRIL 30, 2021 AND\xa0AUGUST 31, 2021.'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-06-03 14:00:00', 'title': 'AMAZON, GOVERNOR BAKER OFFICIALLY OPEN NEW TECH HUB IN BOSTON', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY AMAZON, ALONG WITH MASSACHUSETTS GOVERNOR CHARLIE BAKER, OFFICIALLY WELCOMED EMPLOYEES INSIDE THE NEWEST OFFICE IN BOSTON.'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-06-03 12:00:00', 'title': 'AMZN INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD AMAZON.COM, INC. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'SHAREHOLDERS WITH $100,000 LOSSES OR MORE ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM. LOS ANGELES , JUNE 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE LAW OFFICES OF FRANK R.'}{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-06-03 05:45:00', 'title': 'AMZN SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS AMAZON SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JULY 5, 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF AMAZON.COM, INC. (NASDAQ: AMZN). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/AMAZON-COM-INC-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=28021&FROM=4 THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES FOR SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED AMAZON BETWEEN FEBRUARY 1, 2019 AND\xa0APRIL 5, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2022-06-03 17:36:00', 'title': 'CALIFORNIA AMERICAN WATER ASKS SONOMA