AL. THE PROJECT USES RENEWABLE ELECTRICITY TO SAFELY SPLIT HYDROGEN FROM WATER, AND THE ZERO-CARBON HYDROGEN IS THEN BLENDED AT LOW CONCENTRATIONS WITH NATURAL GAS IN THE UTILITY'S LOCAL DISTRIBUTION SYSTEM."}{'symbol': 'CAG', 'date': '2022-06-03 08:00:00', 'title': 'CONAGRA BRANDS CELEBRATES EMPLOYEE-LED SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT AWARDS PROGRAM', 'text': "EMPLOYEE SUSTAINABILITY INITIATIVES GENERATE NEARLY $9 MILLION IN COMPANY SAVINGS CHICAGO , JUNE 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN CELEBRATION OF WORLD ENVIRONMENT DAY ON JUNE 5, CONAGRA BRANDS (NYSE: CAG) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE WINNERS OF ITS ANNUAL SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT AWARDS, AN EMPLOYEE-LED PROGRAM THAT ENCOURAGES THE DEVELOPMENT AND IMPLEMENTATION OF INNOVATIVE IDEAS RELATED TO SUSTAINABLE PRODUCTION AND BUSINESS PRACTICES. THIS YEAR, EMPLOYEES FROM ACROSS THE ORGANIZATION SUBMITTED A RECORD 211 SUSTAINABILITY-FOCUSED PROJECTS THAT CONSERVE WATER, REDUCE WASTE AND SAVE ENERGY, UNDERSCORING CONAGRA'S COMMITMENT TO NOURISHING AND RESTORING THE PLANET."}{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2022-06-03 20:55:00', 'title': 'DENTSPLY SHAREHOLDER ALERT BY FORMER LOUISIANA ATTORNEY GENERAL: KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC REMINDS INVESTORS WITH LOSSES IN EXCESS OF $100,000 OF LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IN CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST DENTSPLY SIRONA, INC. - XRAY', 'text': "NEW ORLEANS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC (“KSF”) AND KSF PARTNER, FORMER ATTORNEY GENERAL OF LOUISIANA, CHARLES C. FOTI, JR., REMIND INVESTORS THAT THEY HAVE UNTIL AUGUST 1, 2022 TO FILE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPLICATIONS IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST DENTSPLY SIRONA, INC. (NASDAQGS: XRAY), IF THEY PURCHASED THE COMPANY'S SHARES BETWEEN JUNE 9, 2021 AND MAY 9, 2022, INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”). THIS ACTION IS PENDING IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHER"}{'symbol': 'XRAY', 'date': '2022-06-03 19:00:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: RIGRODSKY LAW, P.A. IS INVESTIGATING DENTSPLY SIRONA INC.', 'text': 'WILMINGTON, DELAWARE--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JU